      "source_reading": "The main-text setup assigns mass beta to each known opposing group and prints mass 1 - beta for the new-user group.",
      "memo_heading": "Theorem 4: population masses and positive tolerance ([Section 5, p. 7](https://openreview.net/pdf?id=ZOZjMs3JTs#page=7); [Appendix E, p. 39](https://openreview.net/pdf?id=ZOZjMs3JTs#page=39))",
      "memo_anchor": "theorem-4-population-masses-and-positive-tolerance-section-5-p-7-appendix-e-p-39",
      "report_home": 10
    },
    "defect/GCG24-E15-CENTER-MIRROR-01": {
      "disposition": "memo",
      "memo": "docs/APPENDIX_E_LEMMA15_SOURCE_NOTE.md",
      "memo_sha256": "54f52245a171c6f9e0b78c7df54a7d29a421fee5aea189ebd6b07fd48274fa92",
      "source_reading": "At the center pivot, the source displays lambda = (2 beta q_t + (1 - 2 beta)) / (1 + q_t L_t).",
      "memo_heading": "Appendix E Lemma 15 Source Clarification",
      "memo_anchor": "appendix-e-lemma-15-source-clarification",
      "report_home": 4
    },
    "convention/GCG24-P2-EQUALITY-DEFINED-TYPE-PARTITION-01": {
      "disposition": "not_material",
      "reason": "The source defines types by equality of complete utility rows; no hypothesis or conclusion changes."
    },
    "convention/GCG24-T4-POPULATION-MASS-01": {
      "disposition": "memo",
      "memo": "docs/SOURCE_CLARIFICATIONS.md",
      "memo_sha256": "f5d8b4ae748534f9fe064338e44f64515d5eea912c6f49d0910813713f1a8248",
      "source_reading": "The two known opposing types have masses beta and beta, and the cold-start type has mass 1 - 2 beta. The source's printed 1 - beta cold-start mass is replaced only for this normalized three-type construction; beta < 1/2 keeps that mass positive.",
      "memo_heading": "Theorem 4: population masses and positive tolerance ([Section 5, p. 7](https://openreview.net/pdf?id=ZOZjMs3JTs#page=7); [Appendix E, p. 39](https://openreview.net/pdf?id=ZOZjMs3JTs#page=39))",
      "memo_anchor": "theorem-4-population-masses-and-positive-tolerance-section-5-p-7-appendix-e-p-39",
      "report_home": 10
    },
    "convention/GCG24-T4-POSITIVE-TOLERANCE-01": {
